# build output (re-created by the build / Docker)
**/target/
pr-ui/node_modules/
pr-ui/test-results/
pr-ui/playwright-report/
pr-ui/e2e/.auth/
# tools/ (bundled Maven, Node and the Maven library cache) IS committed, so a new Windows machine can build and
# test without downloading anything; only the project's own artifacts that "mvn install" writes into the cache
# are left out (they change on every build)
tools/m2repo/com/hospital/
# backup/ IS committed (private repository): dumps contain the demo patients and users' password hashes
*.log
